      <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:1.5em">We started posting food because we kept getting asked for the same recipes. This site exists because a caption can't hold a method.</p>
      <p>Instagram is good at showing you what something looks like and useless at telling you why it worked. So the videos live over there, and the reasoning lives here — one dish at a time.</p>
      <p>Most of what we cook is Indian, with a lot of borrowing from everywhere else we've eaten well. Some of it is quick weeknight food, some takes a Sunday, and we say which before you're already halfway in.</p>
